    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fox collects gems and songs in dream world adventure game.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dream world </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sleeping forest to mount ways, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from flowering meadows to ice castles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure and dream world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >journey will be unforgettable! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/bad0bcaa8b695bdb643f0619c27e0cbe.poster.avif?t=1751241739\" width=270 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/bad0bcaa8b695bdb643f0619c27e0cbe.webm?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/bad0bcaa8b695bdb643f0619c27e0cbe.mp4?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles on the way </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple logic puzzles on the way </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will not let you get bored </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and poetic tips and hints </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will help you solve it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/c42907afa581a5d6ee5948981b46a437.poster.avif?t=1751241739\" width=270 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/c42907afa581a5d6ee5948981b46a437.webm?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/c42907afa581a5d6ee5948981b46a437.mp4?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect fragments of songs </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found and collect </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fragments of forgotten songs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ancient runes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and gemstones </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to restore the power of song. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/c15f52dbeb6816064a272e414fdb8e0e.poster.avif?t=1751241739\" width=270 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/c15f52dbeb6816064a272e414fdb8e0e.webm?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/c15f52dbeb6816064a272e414fdb8e0e.mp4?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the way to home </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the way to home, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you need collect all songs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter to this dream world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hope and happiness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This way awaits for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/f537e873c9ddd9452c94ad17e7fdc5f9.poster.avif?t=1751241739\" width=270 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/f537e873c9ddd9452c94ad17e7fdc5f9.webm?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383630/extras/f537e873c9ddd9452c94ad17e7fdc5f9.mp4?t=1751241739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With LOVE from Ukraine! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game made by </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solo indie game developer from Ukraine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will hope you like my game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you and be happy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
